## Environment
- The test env file has DATABASE_URL only and the clone has no dev env file, so the test servers refused to start (BETTER_AUTH_SECRET is not set).
  The e2e runs passed a throwaway BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=$(openssl rand -hex 32) in the shell, as ci.yml does.
